flowchart TD
  Start([进入OREP]) --> Auth{是否登录}
  Auth -- 否 --> Intro[引导页/登录]
  Intro --> Login[登录/注册]
  Login --> Home[备赛工作台]
  Auth -- 是 --> Home
  Home --> Learn[课程学习]
  Learn --> Exam[练习/考试]
  Exam --> Team[项目团队]
  Team --> Prep[项目准备/赛道匹配]
  Prep --> Material[PPT/讲稿]
  Material --> Meeting[在线路演]
  Meeting --> Score[人工评分/AI评分]
  Score --> Report[评分报告]
  Report --> Action[整改任务]
  Action --> Team
  Action --> Meeting
